There is a potential race condition in `observeSharedRefresh` if the lock owner finishes writing the cache and deletes the lock directory in the small window between `readGreetingCache` returning `null` and `statSync` running. In this scenario, `statSync` will throw `ENOENT`, causing the follower to catch the error and exit immediately without emitting the newly written greeting. Performing one final cache check in the `catch` block before returning ensures the follower doesn't miss the completed greeting.

```javascript
