If `statSync(lockDir)` fails (for example, because the lock is temporarily renamed during stale lock reclamation by another process), the follower will enter this `catch` block. If the cache is not yet written, `readGreetingCache` will return `null`, and the follower will immediately `return` and stop polling. This causes the follower to prematurely abort and miss the subsequent cache publication.

